ICE) (Worthington). Evan deve così conquistare il cuore di Faye prima che vengano scoperti e che lui perda tutto."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Faye attempts to replace her newly deceased husband, Evan, with an android simulant (SIM). Although SIM Evan appears like human Evan in every way, Faye does not feel the same love for SIM Evan as it does for her. SIM Evan tries to win Faye back while at the same time being on-the-run from a government agent chasing down SIMs who have become “conscious” and could potentially be a threat to humankind."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gZwE9H71egMeBaL81EfaRO4kun9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmStpqOfwZt7tUbGZXp3VbSL8a0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"en-US","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iKVvC0QeYInQPNAxIFZJU51PuXc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iKVvC0QeYInQPNAxIFZJU51PuXc.jpg","language":"xx","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u7ZwH93eoSf4Cv1ZXJeUgjw4grF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u7ZwH93eoSf4Cv1ZXJeUgjw4grF.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DUrTzYKi9pq2lI6ldBRJ0kNYic.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DUrTzYKi9pq2lI6ldBRJ0kNYic.jpg","language":"xx","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kmDJhZIq1xnu5ZiMOlb0nHJH1qb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kmDJhZIq1xnu5ZiMOlb0nHJH1qb.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hQx2CeM1AZXRg4rIyMl7DPYFhz1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hQx2CeM1AZXRg4rIyMl7DPYFhz1.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/o